Freyja 3D (Brisingamen) — Asgard skill plugin
=============================================

The engine's own material (`engine/reference/*.md`, `engine/scripts/*.mjs`,
`engine/data/*.json`, `engine/scripts/cad_build.py`, `engine/scripts/cad_gate.py`)
is Asgard's work.

The CAD, fabrication, robot-description, and viewer runtime under
`skills/asgard-freyja-3d/engine/vendor/text-to-cad/` is a vendored copy of a
third-party, MIT-licensed skill library. The STEP-first generation pipeline,
the `cadpy` selector-reference and topology runtime, the assembly/joint helper,
the headless snapshot renderer, the DXF/G-code/step.parts/SendCutSend
workflows, the implicit-CAD runtime, the URDF/SRDF/SDF generators, and CAD
Viewer are the upstream's work, not Asgard's.

